    "image_with_text_YFz6rM": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_4W4pwU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Find Perfect Taper Candles for Any Occasion",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_7FLkyj": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The timeless design of our taper candles works across all styles: elegant, rustic, formal, or minimal. From wedding aisles and dinner tables to religious ceremonies or restaurant centerpieces, these candles create a sense of refinement without effort.</p><p>Our collection includes a wide range of sizes and finishes, so you can choose exactly what suits your event. Hosting a large gathering? Need bulk quantities of wedding taper candles for multiple tables? We keep everything in stock and ready to ship. Looking for premium 10-inch taper candles or cheap taper candles without sacrificing quality? At Kisco, you’ll find great value-for-money options that deliver a clean, elegant look.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_4W4pwU",
