    "image_with_text_NKiwke": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_9dtrhQ": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Premium Tall Taper Candles with Clean Burn",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_pEQcpU": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_m7GtwF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Clean lines. Steady flames. No mess. That’s what sets our tall taper candles apart. Made from high-quality wax with high-quality wicks, these candles offer a reliable burn that stays upright and drip-free from start to finish.</p><p>Choose longer styles to add height and drama to your decor. A tall taper draws the eye and adds vertical balance to floral arrangements and table setups. And thanks to the slow, even burn, your candles won’t fizzle out halfway through the night.</p><p>Need something that works as hard as you do on event day? Our long taper candles handle it all, from home decor to 5-star dining rooms and outdoor receptions. Just light them once and let the glow carry your setting through the evening. Our collection is a trusted source for decorators and venues who rely on high-performance taper candles that look stunning from start to finish.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_9dtrhQ",
        "border_pEQcpU",
        "text_m7GtwF"
