    "image_with_text_X8JWKz": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_KEgaty": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why Choose Tall Taper Candles for Your Decor",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_KWtGb3": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_DJwCxi": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When your decor calls for subtle elegance, tall taper candles deliver every time. These 11.5 or 10-inch taper candles have a sleek profile that adds shape and depth without blocking sightlines. Paired with the right holders, they elevate any tablescape and bring an instant sense of occasion.</p><p>Long taper candles do more than just look good. They perform. Their extended burn time keeps your space illuminated longer, making them ideal for ceremonies, receptions, and formal dinners. You can space them evenly across tables or use them to highlight specific focal points.</p><p>Need classic lighting that looks great in photos and real life? Taper up. They never go out of style.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
