    "image_with_text_J6w9t4": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_RXhMUw": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Kisco Quality: Clean-Burning, Elegant Taper Candles",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_akKywE": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_anKmQ4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Kisco Candles, quality comes standard. Our taper candles are made using premium European wax, braided cotton wicks, and precise molding techniques for a smooth finish and consistent flame. That means no drips, no smoke, and no surprises.</p><p>Customers count on us for bulk reliability and polished results at every scale. From cheap taper candles in value packs to metallic finishes in individual wraps, each piece meets our high standards. And with fast shipping and top-rated service, you’ll never be left waiting when time matters most.</p><p>Looking for clean-burning elegance that holds up under pressure? You can always count on Kisco taper candles.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
