          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Step into a world where each candle flickers with the essence of the countryside. <strong>Kisco's taper candles collection is all about bringing that welcoming, elegant vibe into your space. </strong>These candles, available in a range of colors like ivory and red, create a sense of classic décor in any room. Their 10\" size makes them an ideal addition to any setting, whether a romantic dinner or a gathering with friends. <strong>Bolsius taper candles are crafted to complement any design, adding effortless sophistication. </strong>Light up one of these Bolsius candles and let it transport you to a place of comfort and tranquility. Whether you're styling a dinner party or an altar, these taper candles bring timeless beauty to every occasion.</p>",
