            "text": "<p>Each Kisco taper candle tells a story of meticulous craftsmanship and unwavering quality. From selecting premium,<strong>vegan wax to carefully crafting cotton wicks, every candle is a testament to the artistry and care that goes into its creation. </strong><a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bolsius-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Bolsius candles </span></a>are crafted to burn cleanly and consistently, ensuring a long-lasting and enjoyable experience. <strong>Using Bolsius’ high-quality materials means that each candle looks beautiful and enhances your space with its smokeless, steady light. </strong>For a broader selection of quality candles, explore the <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">pillar candles </span></a>collection.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
