        "column_WmnJ8C": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "accent": "",
            "heading": "Consider the Occasion",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Weddings:</strong> The elegant silhouette and soft light make taper candles ideal for wedding ceremonies and receptions. Save on <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bulk-wedding-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bulk wedding candles here</span></a>.</li><li><strong>Romantic Dinners:</strong> Opt for our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles/products/bolsius-tall-10-inch-taper-candles-30-pack-wedding-decorative-hoilday-colored-unscented-taper-candles?variant=40111505047661\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">classic ivory taper candles</span></a> or deep red to add a touch of romance and elegance.</li><li><strong>Holiday Gatherings: </strong>Choose from our seasonal colors to complement your festive décor and create a cozy, inviting atmosphere.</li><li><strong>Everyday Elegance: </strong>Our rustic taper candles collection offers a variety of colors to enhance the daily charm of your living space.</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75",
            "text_max_width": 100,
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary"
          }
        },
        "column_DtmwKW": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "accent": "",
            "heading": "Match Your Décor",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Color Coordination:</strong> Select candles that complement your existing décor. Our range includes colors crafted to align with your home or event space. Browse our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles/products/bolsius-tall-10-inch-taper-candles-4-8-12-16-pack-wedding-decorative-hoilday-colored-unscented-taper-candles?variant=40097438564461\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">dark red</span></a> or the <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles/products/bolsius-tall-10-inch-metallic-taper-candles-12-pack-wedding-decorative-hoilday-colored-unscented-taper-candles-individually-wrapped?variant=40111502000237\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">metallic gold</span></a> to make a statement in your décor. Even add a vibrant <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles/products/bolsius-tall-10-inch-taper-candles-10-pack-wedding-decorative-hoilday-colored-unscented-taper-candles?variant=40097614135405\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">pink</span></a> to set the mood for a special occasion. </li><li><strong>Size and Placement:</strong> Consider the 10\" size of our taper candles for a balanced look on dinner tables, mantles, or as part of a centerpiece. Shop our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles/products/bolsius-7-inch-houshold-taper-candles-45-pack-wedding-decorative-hoilday-colored-unscented-taper-candles?variant=40111517630573\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">7” taper candles</span></a> for smaller settings.</li></ul><p></p><h3>Enhance Your Experience</h3><ul><li><strong>Smokeless Enjoyment</strong>: Our long candles are crafted to be smokeless, enhancing your indoor air quality while providing a serene candlelight experience.</li><li><strong>Long-Lasting Burn: </strong>Choose candles known for their longevity, ensuring that your evenings are illuminated for longer.</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100",
            "text_max_width": 100,
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary"
          }
        }
